flowchart TD
    A[Client sends request] --> B{Has Authorization header?}
    B -- No --> C[Return 401 Access token required]
    B -- Yes --> D[Extract Bearer token]
    D --> E{Token valid?}
    E -- No --> F[Return 401 Invalid or expired access token]
    E -- Yes --> G{Endpoint}
    G -- Protected --> H[Allow access to protected route]
    H --> I[Return protected profile data]
    G -- Logout --> J[Call sign_out token on Supabase]
    J --> K[Return 200 Logged out]
    N[Note: Stateless verification — token is validated directly, no server session]
